WEBVTT

00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:10.652
Choose Users in the side menu.

00:00:10.902 --> 00:00:16.902
Type "tunde" in the Search
by email or profile name box.

00:00:18.883 --> 00:00:23.611
Click Search.

00:00:23.861 --> 00:00:29.861
Click tunde@example.test
to open the account.

00:00:30.736 --> 00:00:36.072
Scroll to Support actions.

00:00:36.322 --> 00:00:41.841
Click Reset two step verification.

00:00:42.091 --> 00:00:48.091
Type "Lost phone and codes, owner
confirmed by email" in the Reason box.

00:00:52.266 --> 00:00:58.266
Click Reset two step
verification to confirm.
